wildos-capture (0.1.3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Report a problem in the Options menu opens Report a problem with Capture
    chosen.
  * wildos-capture --to FILE takes one screenshot and writes it to FILE
    only, for Report a problem's "Add a screenshot"; cancelling leaves
    FILE.cancelled instead.

